                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most princely"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0b711ab7-8298-328d-ac97-838d2d96d701",
                        "entry_id": "3c500086-fc7b-3dc5-b89a-2027b49ef0d5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In the manner of a royal prince's conduct."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c1e4fce2-629c-4565-94fc-b70211138542",
                                "sense_id": "0b711ab7-8298-328d-ac97-838d2d96d701",
                                "text": "Has the princely generous Dr. Townsend turned traitor to the old folks?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "003ae493-80e9-4120-a846-4152d994bf6d",
                                "sense_id": "0b711ab7-8298-328d-ac97-838d2d96d701",
                                "text": "[…] my appetite was not princely gote, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7de449a7-1af4-4d7b-9c47-4344eceac07d",
                                "sense_id": "0b711ab7-8298-328d-ac97-838d2d96d701",
                                "text": "Oilman Hall and I tried to interest him in noticing Morgan Robertson, who was passing near the corner of Sixth Avenue and Twenty-third Street, princely dressed in a frock coat and top hat."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "23a1fae1-23a7-402a-a101-959ffcf32e19",
                                "sense_id": "0b711ab7-8298-328d-ac97-838d2d96d701",
                                "text": "“And if this Señor Regan be princely generous, he may give you and me the munificent sum that was mentioned, eh? Five times the sum, or ten times, with this Gringo tiger blowing down law and order and our good jail-walls, would be nearer the mark.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "30a3931b-a61b-425f-9125-92e19cde2e3d",
                                "sense_id": "0b711ab7-8298-328d-ac97-838d2d96d701",
                                "text": "Ron was blithely standing at the window looking out. He was princely dressed in a black suit, and a cream-colored polo sweater. Ron turned around looking debonair as usual."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "57baa339-23b0-419c-9e2e-509c298eb5cd",
                                "sense_id": "0b711ab7-8298-328d-ac97-838d2d96d701",
                                "text": "These are the accepted truths to all who encountered or knew of the princely dressed first sacker, whose three-piece suits and brown velvet derby defined him."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b5dc489b-cce8-4691-a2c5-167a49cbaf73",
                                "sense_id": "0b711ab7-8298-328d-ac97-838d2d96d701",
                                "text": "“Well, the sun was barely gone and the men had dispersed. It was just me and a small squad of men, about to do our rounds when this tall princely dressed man appeared out of nowhere. He was followed by a medium built man wearing the robes of a Caravan master.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "210fa906-fe4b-4f8d-a912-7148d86c5391",
                                "sense_id": "0b711ab7-8298-328d-ac97-838d2d96d701",
                                "text": "Harmeet was a 6 feet tall sardar, good sense of humor as all sardars do. He was also very princely dressed."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e34ceba2-c682-437f-8d7c-92d58040ccca",
                                "sense_id": "0b711ab7-8298-328d-ac97-838d2d96d701",
                                "text": "She moved her big, beautiful, well-diluted eyes up and down his slender princely dressed form."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9e83c365-f48d-44d4-b39d-e5ffa904c683",
                                "sense_id": "0b711ab7-8298-328d-ac97-838d2d96d701",
                                "text": "The men were princely dressed in pin striped suits, fedora hats and broad toe shoes with patterned vamps. I had only seen these desirably dressed men as moving watercolor images in Velvet Rose magazines."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
